      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֵינִי יוֹדֵעַ – חַיָּיב. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>הַשּׂוֹכֵר אוֹמֵר: שְׂכוּרָה מֵתָה,",
