    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>לֵימָא תִּהְוֵי תְּיוּבְתָּא <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2285\" data-full-name=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov\" data-name-he=\"רב נחמן בר יעקב\">דְּרַב נַחְמָן</span>, דְּאִיתְּמַר:",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "״מָנֶה לִי בְּיָדְךָ״, וְהַלָּה אוֹמֵר: אֵינִי יוֹדֵעַ. <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Huna (רב הונא) — second/third-generation Amora, principal disciple of Rav and head of Sura\" data-full-name=\"Rav Huna\" data-name-he=\"רַב הוּנָא א׳\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-14743\" data-resolution-rule=\"rav_huna_early_circle\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Identified as Rav Huna of Sura (895): the immediate sugya pairs him with his documented contemporaries and disciples, and per Rashi (Yevamot 83b) the plain «רב הונא» is this Rav Huna.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;contextual&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Rav-disciple-era interlocutor&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;The immediate sugya pairs this Rav Huna with his documented contemporaries and disciples at Sura (the circle of Rav&#x27;s students), matching the profile of the famous Rav Huna (895), not the later Rav-Ashi-circle homonym.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Girsology contextual review (2026-07)&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;scholarly_source&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Setam-Rav-Huna principle&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Rashi (Yevamot 83b) and Hyman rule that a plain, unqualified «רב הונא» is certainly the famous Rav Huna of Sura — «אבל היכי דאתמר סתמא ודאי הוא ר\\&quot;ה». No later or patronymic qualifier is present here.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Rashi, Yevamot 83b s.v. אמרי בי רב (with Hyman, s.v. רב הונא)&quot;}]\" data-authority-id=\"895\">רַב</span>",
