 bar Ya’akov\" data-name-he=\"רב נחמן בר יעקב\">רַב נַחְמָן</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan II, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1570\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan II\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-14746\">וְרַבִּי</span>",
